": "37"}], "thumbnail": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/FrsjZ3qIOZg/hqdefault.jpg", "description": "Today we unwillingly continue our terrifying journey into the Magical World of Winx where the Winx Club goes camping I continue to hate Bloom which isn't even even funny anymore because every time I see her on screen I just think about how much I hate the fairy bitch. Like Bloom walks around acting like she’s the top bitch and shit but Icy shows up for two minutes and suddenly the episodes gets ten times more interesting. like every time Bloom opens her mouth to give another speech to her winxlings I’m already zoning out eating a burrito but when Icy speaks I’m like yeah bitch tell them Winx Clubbers how useless they are. Honestly Bloom is the reason I root for the villains. She’s the kind of character that makes you think maybe evil isn’t that bad? Like if I had to choose between being in Bloom's little Club or join Icy's squad I’d be I’d be f*cking stupid not to pick the trix. Like come on? Bitch? I’d rather be rolling with Icy and the girls for one day because they're bad bitches than spend an entire school semestor at Alfea listening to Bloom talk about how much better her fire powers are that whatever the f*ck power I would get if I was a stupid fairy.\nIf you like what I do and wanna see more consider joining my twitter and supporting me on patreon cause I'll be doing all 12 episodes.\nTwitter: TheTamers12345\nPatreon: https://www.patreon.com/Tamers12345", "channel_id": "UCEvOnTvFBnDxR0e11qJuP7g", "channel_url": "https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCEvOnTvFBnDxR0e11qJuP7g", "duration": 631, "view_count": 16, "age_limit": 0, "webpage_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=FrsjZ3qIOZg", "categories": ["People & Blogs"], "tags": ["winx", "winx club", "reboot", "recap", "review", "the magic is back", "winx club reboot", "winx club bloom", "winx club season 1", "bloom winx club", "stella winx club", "cartoon review", "anime review", "viral", "sky winx club", "reaction", "react"